<article class="investor-report executive-report" data-investor-report="plan">
<% const asset = report.asset; const plan = report.plan; const accounting = plan.accounting; const amount = value => value === null ? '—' : formatIdr(value); %>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="plan-snapshot">
<%- include('../partials/admin/report-header.ejs',{reportTitle:'12-MONTH PLAN + PROSPECTIVE',subtitle:'Rencana 12 Bulan dan Prospektif'}) %>
<p class="report-section-label">01 / Executive Snapshot</p><h3>Current position, before projections</h3>
<p class="report-intro">Inventory and recorded assets provide the current operating base. Recorded revenue and cash are actual operational facts; forward financial figures depend on complete historical evidence.</p>
<dl class="report-kpis">
<div class="report-kpi report-kpi--lead"><dt>Recorded Assets</dt><dd data-plan-assets><%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Inventory Retail Value</dt><dd data-plan-retail><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Recorded Revenue</dt><dd data-plan-revenue><%= formatIdr(accounting.revenue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Cash Position</dt><dd data-plan-cash><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.endingBalance) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Known Inventory Units</dt><dd><span data-plan-units><%= asset.knownUnits %></span> <small><%= view.unitLabel %></small></dd></div>
</dl>
<dl class="report-status-grid">
<div><dt>Sales History</dt><dd><%= view.historyStatus %></dd><small><span data-plan-sales><%= accounting.saleCount %></span> completed POS / Webstore sales</small></div>
<div><dt>Historical HPP Coverage</dt><dd><%= view.hppStatus %></dd></div>
<div><dt>Financial Projection</dt><dd><%= view.projectionStatus %></dd></div>
<div><dt>Inventory Opportunity</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %></dd><small>Potential Gross Spread</small></div>
</dl>
<% if (accounting.cogs === null) { %><p class="report-takeaway" data-hpp-limitation>Historical profit is not stated because sale-item HPP evidence is incomplete. The known-cost subtotal does not establish total COGS or profit; see Appendix C.</p><% } %>
<% if (plan.legacySales > 0n) { %><p class="report-caption">Recorded performance includes legacy demo-linked sales, not trading history of the newly imported catalog. See Appendix A.</p><% } %>
</section>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="plan-operations">
<p class="report-section-label">02 / Business Position &amp; Operating Plan</p><h3>Turn inventory readiness into consistent operations</h3>
<div class="report-position-grid">
<section class="report-block"><h4>Operations <span class="report-state">Operational Now</span></h4><ul><li>POS for active, eligible inventory</li><li>Inventory / HPP tracking</li><li>Finance ledger and Cash Flow</li><li>Accounting Lite</li><li>Customer cart and unpaid order flow</li></ul></section>
<section class="report-block"><h4>Commercial Position</h4><ul><li><strong><%= view.productCount %></strong> current catalog products</li><li><strong><%= asset.knownUnits %> <%= view.unitLabel %></strong> known inventory</li><li><strong><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></strong> inventory retail capacity</li></ul></section>
<section class="report-block"><h4>Data Completeness</h4><ul><li><strong><%= view.unknownStockProducts %></strong> products require stock confirmation</li><li><strong><%= view.missingWeightProducts %></strong> products have incomplete shipping weights</li><li><%= accounting.cogs === null ? 'Historical sale HPP coverage is incomplete' : accounting.saleCount === 0n ? 'No historical sales to assess HPP coverage' : 'Recorded historical sale HPP coverage is complete' %></li></ul></section>
</div>
<section class="report-block"><h3>12-Month Operating Plan</h3><p class="report-caption">Planned priorities and indicative sequencing, not delivery commitments or financial targets. Existing cart/unpaid orders are operational; completed checkout and provider integrations remain planned.</p>
<ol class="report-roadmap">
<li><h4>0–3 months <span class="report-state">Planned</span></h4><ul><li>Complete stock confirmation and shipping weights</li><li>Complete real product media</li><li>Stabilize Webstore readiness</li></ul></li>
<li><h4>3–6 months <span class="report-state">Planned</span></h4><ul><li>Develop completed Webstore checkout</li><li>Integrate payment and shipping providers</li><li>Extend the existing customer order flow</li></ul></li>
<li><h4>6–9 months <span class="report-state">Planned</span></h4><ul><li>Improve repeat sales and review channel expansion</li><li>Optimize inventory</li><li>Maintain consistent monthly reporting</li></ul></li>
<li><h4>9–12 months <span class="report-state">Planned</span></h4><ul><li>Scale suitable sales channels and optimize product mix</li><li>Strengthen repeat customer revenue</li><li>Build investor-ready performance history</li></ul></li>
</ol></section>
</section>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="plan-outlook">
<p class="report-section-label">03 / Prospective &amp; Outlook</p><h3>Current Inventory Sales Capacity</h3>
<dl class="report-kpis report-kpis--three">
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Inventory Retail Value</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Inventory at HPP</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt>Potential Gross Spread</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %></dd></div>
</dl>
<p class="report-takeaway">Potential Gross Spread is not guaranteed profit. It excludes operating expenses, discounts, unsold inventory risk, payment fees, shipping costs, returns and tax.</p>
<p class="report-caption">Gross spread compares retail and HPP for the same complete stock-and-cost cohort; comparable retail value is <%= formatIdr(asset.comparativeRetail) %>. Inventory retail value is not guaranteed revenue.</p>
<section class="report-block"><h3>12-Month Financial Projection</h3>
<% if (!plan.projection) { %><p class="report-projection-note" data-projection-unavailable>12-month financial projection is not yet presented because historical operating data is not sufficiently complete and reliable.</p><% } else { const projection = plan.projection; %>
<p data-projection-available>Run-rate projection based on recorded historical performance, not a guaranteed forecast. Qualifying period: <%= projection.from %> to <%= projection.to %>, <%= projection.months %> complete months / <%= projection.days %> complete days.</p>
<dl class="report-facts"><div><dt>Revenue run rate</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.revenue) %></dd></div><div><dt>COGS run rate</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.cogs) %></dd></div><div><dt>Gross profit run rate</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.grossProfit) %></dd></div><div><dt>Expense run rate</dt><dd><%= amount(projection.expenses) %></dd></div><div><dt>Net profit run rate</dt><dd><%= amount(projection.netProfit) %></dd></div></dl>
<% if (projection.expenses === null || projection.netProfit === null) { %><p class="report-caption">Expense and net run rates are not stated without confirmed expense coverage.</p><% } %>
<% } %><p>Evidence requirements and the existing run-rate method are retained in Appendix D.</p></section>
<nav class="report-appendix-index" aria-label="Plan report appendices"><h3>Supporting evidence</h3><a href="#plan-appendix-a">Appendix A — Historical Performance Detail</a><a href="#plan-appendix-b">Appendix B — Cash Flow Detail</a><a href="#plan-appendix-c">Appendix C — Accounting / HPP Limitations</a><a href="#plan-appendix-d">Appendix D — Projection Methodology</a><a href="#plan-appendix-e">Appendix E — Risks &amp; Assumptions</a></nav>
</section>
<div class="report-appendices">
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-a" data-report-appendix="A"><p class="report-section-label">Appendix A</p><h3>Historical Performance Detail</h3>
<p>Actual completed POS and Webstore sales from <%= plan.period.fromInput %> through the report's as-of instant, using existing UTC transaction-period semantics. Manual income remains cash-only.</p>
<p data-legacy-disclosure><%= plan.legacySales %> completed sales are linked to legacy demo SKUs. These records remain in accounting history and must not be presented as sales of the newly imported owner workbook catalog. Catalog archival does not remove historical transactions.</p>
<table class="report-summary-table"><caption>Recorded performance — a dash indicates a measure not stated; see Appendix C</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Measure</th><th scope="col">Recorded value</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row">Completed sales</th><td><%= accounting.saleCount %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Revenue</th><td><%= formatIdr(accounting.revenue) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Known COGS subtotal</th><td><%= formatIdr(accounting.knownCogs) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Total COGS</th><td><%= amount(accounting.cogs) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gross profit</th><td><%= amount(accounting.grossProfit) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Operating expenses</th><td><%= formatIdr(accounting.operatingExpenses) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Net profit</th><td><%= amount(accounting.netProfit) %></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<h4>Contributing completed sales</h4><p class="report-caption">Up to 100 most recent completed sales from the canonical report. Summary figures cover the full report period.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Historical completed sales"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Reference</th><th scope="col">Date (UTC)</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Revenue</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of accounting.recentSales) { %><tr><th scope="row"><%= row.reference %></th><td><%= row.occurredAt.toISOString().replace('T',' ').slice(0,16) %></td><td><%= view.sourceLabels[row.source] ?? row.source %></td><td><%= formatIdr(row.revenue) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div><% if (!accounting.recentSales.length) { %><p>No completed sales recorded in this period.</p><% } %>
<h4>Historical sale-item costs</h4><p class="report-caption">Up to 200 recent sold lines; costs are historical snapshots, not current catalog HPP. A dash means missing historical cost.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Historical sale item HPP"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Reference / Product</th><th scope="col">Variant / SKU</th><th scope="col">Quantity</th><th scope="col">HPP / unit</th><th scope="col">Line COGS</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of accounting.recentItems) { %><tr><th scope="row"><%= row.reference %><br /><%= row.product %></th><td><%= row.variant %><br /><%= row.sku %></td><td><%= row.quantity %></td><td><%= amount(row.unitCost) %></td><td><%= row.cogs === null ? '—' : formatIdr(BigInt(row.cogs)) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div>
<h4>Contributing operating expenses</h4><p class="report-caption">Up to 100 most recent posted expenses. Voided entries are excluded from expense totals.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Historical operating expenses"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date (UTC)</th><th scope="col">Reference</th><th scope="col">Category</th><th scope="col">Description</th><th scope="col">Expense</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of accounting.recentExpenses) { %><tr><td><%= row.occurredAt.toISOString().replace('T',' ').slice(0,16) %></td><th scope="row"><%= row.id %></th><td><%= view.categoryLabels[row.category] ?? row.category %></td><td><%= row.notes ?? 'Manual expense' %></td><td><%= formatIdr(row.total) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix report-appendix--new-page" id="plan-appendix-b" data-report-appendix="B"><p class="report-section-label">Appendix B</p><h3>Cash Flow Detail</h3>
<dl class="report-facts"><div><dt>Opening balance</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.openingBalance) %></dd></div><div><dt>Recorded income</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.income) %></dd></div><div><dt>Recorded expenses</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.expenses) %></dd></div><div><dt>Net cash movement</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.net) %></dd></div><div><dt>Ending balance</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.endingBalance) %></dd></div></dl>
<p>Opening balance plus recorded income less expenses gives the ending balance. Voided entries are excluded. Cash Flow is not profit or a bank reconciliation.</p>
<div class="report-two-columns"><section class="report-block"><h4>Income by source</h4><ul><% for (const row of plan.cash.bySource) { %><li><%= view.sourceLabels[row.key] ?? row.key %>: <%= formatIdr(row.total) %></li><% } %></ul></section><section class="report-block"><h4>Expenses by category</h4><ul><% for (const row of plan.cash.byCategory) { %><li><%= view.categoryLabels[row.key] ?? row.key %>: <%= formatIdr(row.total) %></li><% } %></ul></section></div>
<p class="report-caption">Up to 200 most recent ledger entries are shown from <%= plan.cash.transactionCount %> entries in the period, including void audit context. Totals use all qualifying posted movements.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Cash flow transaction detail"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date (UTC)</th><th scope="col">Reference</th><th scope="col">Direction / Source</th><th scope="col">Category / Notes</th><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of plan.cash.transactions) { %><tr><td><%= row.occurredAt.toISOString().replace('T',' ').slice(0,16) %></td><th scope="row"><%= row.transactionNumber ?? row.id %></th><td><%= row.direction %> / <%= view.sourceLabels[row.source] ?? row.source %></td><td><%= view.categoryLabels[row.category] ?? row.category %><br /><%= row.notes ?? '' %><% if (row.voidReason) { %><br />Void reason: <%= row.voidReason %><% } %></td><td><%= formatIdr(row.amountRupiah) %></td><td><%= row.status %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-c" data-report-appendix="C"><p class="report-section-label">Appendix C</p><h3>Accounting / HPP Limitations</h3>
<p><%= accounting.missingItemCount %> historical sale lines lack HPP; <%= accounting.missingSaleCount %> completed sales lack item records. Where either exists, total COGS and both profit measures are not stated. Known COGS is only a subtotal of known historical costs; zero known cost does not mean complete costs are zero.</p>
<p>Revenue comes only from completed POS / Webstore sales. Manual income remains cash-only. Current costs never backfill historical snapshots. Operating expenses are posted manual operating expenses; opening balances, automated sale income and voided rows do not become operating expenses. Global overhead planning is not an automatic profit deduction.</p>
<p>Current asset basis: inventory at HPP <%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %> plus active fixed acquisition value <%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %> gives recorded assets of <%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %>. There are <%= asset.incompleteCount %> incomplete inventory items.</p>
<p>Inventory opportunity uses current recorded inventory; accounting profit uses historical sold-item cost snapshots. Incomplete quantity/cost rows are excluded from relevant inventory totals. Disposed assets are excluded from active fixed acquisition value. Fixed assets are not depreciated book values.</p>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-d" data-report-appendix="D"><p class="report-section-label">Appendix D</p><h3>Projection Methodology</h3>
<p>Only explicitly documented sales-complete calendar months immediately preceding the current UTC month qualify, with at least 30 complete days, complete sale-item HPP and no itemless completed sales. Missing reliability evidence suppresses projection; elapsed time since a first sale is not evidence of reliable coverage.</p>
<p>Run rate = qualifying actual total × 12 ÷ complete months, truncated toward zero to whole Rupiah. Expense and net projections additionally require confirmed expense coverage for every included month. No one-day or incomplete history is annualized. Coverage evidence has no editable forecasting UI in this phase.</p>
<% if (plan.projection) { %><p>Current qualifying evidence: <%= plan.projection.from %> to <%= plan.projection.to %>, <%= plan.projection.months %> months / <%= plan.projection.days %> complete days. Values in the main outlook come directly from the canonical backend projection.</p><% } else { %><p>No qualifying projection is presented in this report instance.</p><% } %>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-e" data-report-appendix="E"><p class="report-section-label">Appendix E</p><h3>Risks &amp; Assumptions</h3><ul class="report-key-notes"><li>Actual figures originate from LOKKA operational records, including disclosed legacy/demo-linked history.</li><li>Inventory retail value is not guaranteed revenue. Potential gross spread excludes operating expenses, discounts, unsold inventory risk, payment fees, shipping/payment costs, returns and tax.</li><li>No new financing amount, sales growth, future staffing, guaranteed revenue or profit is assumed.</li><li>Roadmap phases are planned operating priorities. POS, catalog/media management, inventory/HPP, finance, Cash Flow, Accounting Lite, cart and unpaid order creation/cancellation are available now. Completed Webstore checkout, payment and shipping provider integration remain planned.</li><li>Unknown stock and missing shipping weights require owner confirmation. Actual product photography must be supplied through the operational catalog flow.</li><li>Asset scope is nonarchived inventory plus active fixed acquisition value, not a complete balance sheet. Source product names and the owner's fixed-asset classification remain unchanged; no depreciation method, useful life or book value is inferred.</li></ul>
</section>
</div></article>
